B.MM=new A.hR("Harmattan","assets/portfolio/harmattan_cover.webp","A multilingual educational web experience about the Harmattan wind, built with semantic HTML and modern CSS. It demonstrates responsive layout, accessibility-minded content structure, and CSS-only theming and interactions.","https://github.com/koidioble/harmattan","https://koidioble.github.io/harmattan/","Live","Harmattan pairs two things in one project: a factually-researched explainer on the real Harmattan wind \u2014 its formation, and its impact on health, aviation, agriculture, and the regions it crosses \u2014 and a UI-patterns playground demonstrating what pure CSS can still do without a framework. Every fact is sourced and cited; every interactive pattern (theme switch, language switch, modal, animated chart) runs on CSS alone, no JavaScript anywhere.",B.EY,B.MI,B.Iv,B.H9,B.HF)
