B.MO=new A.hR("Sii-Kaa","assets/portfolio/siikaa_ai_cover.webp","A Flutter currency analytics application that presents API-driven exchange-rate data for more than 170 currencies, with search, visualization, preferences, and Firebase-backed application services.",null,"https://www.sii-kaa.com","Live","Sii-Kaa is a cross-platform currency analytics platform built for the global financialmarket and the diaspora. Tracks over 170 world currencies in real time, with a focus on global exchange rates underserved by mainstream financial tools.",B.Fb,B.MK,B.Hf,B.Hx,B.Ip)
